---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Website Privacy"
  description="How the Utopia Logistics website handles information when you prepare a freight enquiry, open an email draft, or follow a map link."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title={'Your information.\nYour next enquiry.'}
    description="A plain-language explanation of how this website handles the details you choose to share."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container privacy-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Preparing a quote request</h2>
        <p>
          The quote form asks for your name, company, email, shipment route,
          preferred date, and freight description. Phone, estimated weight, and
          additional details are optional. These details help describe the
          shipment you want to discuss.
        </p>
        {site.quoteEndpoint ? (
          <p>
            When you submit the form, your information is sent to the connected
            enquiry service for processing. Its response page provides the
            submission result. Contact dispatch if you need to verify that your
            enquiry was received.
          </p>
        ) : (
          <p>
            Preparing and reviewing a request happens in your browser. The
            website does not send those form details to dispatch automatically
            or save them in browser storage. Refreshing or leaving the page may
            clear your entries.
          </p>
        )}
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Email drafts and downloads</h2>
        <p>
          Opening a prepared email passes its contents to your email app. You
          decide whether to send it. Once sent, the information is handled
          through the email services used by you and Utopia Logistics. A
          downloaded request is a text file saved by your browser; you control
          where you keep or share it.
        </p>
        <p>
          For a longer request, the website asks you to download the full text
          and attach it to your email. No shipment information needs to be
          omitted from your enquiry.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Links and website resources</h2>
        <p>
          The site’s fonts, photographs, and map illustration are served as part
          of the website. No advertising trackers, analytics scripts, or
          embedded third-party maps have been added to this build.
        </p>
        <p>
          Choosing “Get directions” opens Google Maps. That service handles
          information according to its own privacy practices. Phone and email
          links open the relevant app on your device. Website hosting and
          network providers may process technical request information needed to
          serve the site.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about information you have shared with Utopia Logistics,
          including an enquiry you want to correct or discuss, contact{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or{' '}
          <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. Include enough context for
          the team to identify your enquiry.
        </p>
        <address>
          {site.name}
          <br />
          {site.street}
          <br />
          {site.locality}
          <br />
          Canada
        </address>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .privacy-content > section + section {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 35px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 550;
    letter-spacing: -0.7px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .privacy-content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.95;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .privacy-content address {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-top: 23px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .privacy-content h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .privacy-content p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }
</style>
